1
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:05,024
For centuries, sailors told stories about the kraken.

2
00:00:05,157 --> 00:00:06,880
It turned out to be real.

3
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:10,775
The giant squid can grow as long as a bus.

4
00:00:10,845 --> 00:00:13,804
Its eyes are the size of dinner plates.

5
00:00:13,854 --> 00:00:16,000
The biggest in the animal kingdom.

6
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,363
It has three hearts.

7
00:00:17,413 --> 00:00:19,371
And its blood is blue.

8
00:00:19,441 --> 00:00:23,530
Its brain is shaped like a doughnut, wrapped around its throat.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:26,609
So everything it eats goes through its brain.

10
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:33,328
And yet, nobody had ever seen one alive in the deep until 2004.

11
00:00:33,398 --> 00:00:39,067
The first video of one in its home only came in 2012, off Japan.

12
00:00:39,137 --> 00:00:41,874
Its great enemy is the sperm whale.

13
00:00:41,944 --> 00:00:45,953
Whales have been found covered in sucker scars from their fights.

14
00:00:46,403 --> 00:00:48,349
The kraken was never a myth.

15
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:50,639
It was just hiding in the dark.
